<div class="wp-block-wd-row wd-d2130e7f"><!-- wp:wd/column {"blockId":"e8b13b2c-55ca-45ea-933e-d6cd8ee411df","blockVersion":"2","adjacentCount":2,"colWidth":60} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-column wd-e8b13b2c"><!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"dcda744c-0267-4c64-93ec-74ea95c9ecd7","blockVersion":"2","content":"Select, Access, Enjoy","tpFontSizeMobile":"22"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-dcda744c">Select, Access, Enjoy</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"e39e4ae5-4782-4c6f-bf2b-b295600d188b","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-e39e4ae5">Our approach is centered around assisting everyone in selecting, affording, and deriving pleasure from technology. Customers form the core of our endeavors. Continuously, we strive to enhance the customer journey, providing value for all stakeholders.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph -->

<!-- wp:wd/container {"blockId":"52a47eea-5eb0-489c-ba70-7a72a096d06a","blockVersion":"2","rowGap":"10"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-container wd-dir-col wd-52a47eea"><!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"320020e6-8cd1-4ff4-9376-5e3a7799bcd7","blockVersion":"2","design":"","content":"Select","iconPositionHorizontal":"start","tpFontSize":"18"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-320020e6">Select</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"e42f192e-49b2-4abf-9c02-5f1468889f98","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-e42f192e">We aid customers in selecting the appropriate technology from an extensive array of products, available both in our online store. Our proficient and dedicated team members offer expert in-person guidance to assist customers in making informed decisions.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/container -->

<!-- wp:wd/container {"blockId":"0436a12a-7458-46fd-b75e-5c6145a0a367","blockVersion":"2","rowGap":"10"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-container wd-dir-col wd-0436a12a"><!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"2fb155d4-42c4-4b25-9d32-fafb3bed6b78","blockVersion":"2","design":"","content":"Access","iconPositionHorizontal":"start","tpFontSize":"18"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-2fb155d4">Access</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"091230d1-f496-4aa4-ae95-55e5c89ed096","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-091230d1">Customers find technology exciting but expensive. We help everyone afford the technology they need. We can spread the cost of tech through the responsible use of credit.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/container -->

<!-- wp:wd/container {"blockId":"18f6676e-a509-446c-a3cf-9c90b35a781a","blockVersion":"2","rowGap":"10"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-container wd-dir-col wd-18f6676e"><!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"13ccfe68-51e1-4683-9b2b-6db5c62ddbdf","blockVersion":"2","design":"","content":"Enjoy","iconPositionHorizontal":"start","tpFontSize":"18"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-13ccfe68">Enjoy</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"6756725b-0a5b-4750-bb5b-3a0b03460c44","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-6756725b">Our distinct position enables us to enhance customers' lifelong enjoyment of their tech, fostering enduring and more valuable relationships for both our customers and our business.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/container --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/column -->

<!-- wp:wd/column {"blockId":"2427abe5-a68a-447c-bc0e-ea41dc509d5d","blockVersion":"2","adjacentCount":2,"colWidth":40} -->
